      "mergedPostDetails": "Since build 1277, the Animator Tracking Control behavior in the avatar's Gesture layer no longer works.\n\nIt is possible that the above is not slightly accurate and only the Fingers of the Animator Tracking Control are stuck regardless of the Playable layer.\n\nIn any case, the Fingers in the Animator Tracking Control of the Gesture layer stopped working after the update.",
